    <briefdescription>
<para>The values and first derivatives of the non-zero 1D B-splines at the 1D quadrature points. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The tensor product B-splines and the quadrature grid both have a tensor product structure. The value of a tensor product B-spline at a quadrature point can therefore be computed from the values of the 1D B-splines at the 1D quadrature points. The memory required to store these values is O(N_r + N_theta).</para>
<para>The B-spline index stored in the stash is the offset from the first non-zero B-spline at the quadrature point.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>QDimRMesh</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classQuadrature" kindref="compound">Quadrature</ref> mesh in radial direction. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>QDimThetaMesh</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classQuadrature" kindref="compound">Quadrature</ref> mesh in poloidal direction. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername><ref refid="structBSplinesR" kindref="compound">BSplinesR</ref></parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Splines in radial direction. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername><ref refid="structBSplinesTheta" kindref="compound">BSplinesTheta</ref></parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Splines in poloidal direction. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
